# Ephemeral Playwright MCP snapshot YAMLs at the repo root — these are
# per-tool-call dumps that accumulate by the dozen on every e2e run and
# carry no diagnostic value off-session. Keep `.playwright-mcp/e2e/` and
# `.playwright-mcp/review/` (curated PNG screenshots) trackable.
.playwright-mcp/*.yml
.playwright-mcp/page-*.yml
.playwright-mcp/console-*.log

